# ThumbnailUploader on DemoPage

## Source of truth
- Section: `demo-audit/ThumbnailUploaderDemo.vue`, wired on DemoPage **above** Media Uploader Helper Components.
- One sample per distinct look from real call sites: Preview Settings upload thumbnail, preview video trailer, Publish custom image/video, UploadMediaPopup tall dropzone, AddTierPopup plain icon, PlanDetail underlined plain + custom wrapper, EditProfile gallery green badge, PayoutCosmo compact + `PayoutCdnIcon`, OrderDetails compact default badge.
- Show Code uses the real component + feature `t()` keys (`mediaUploader.*`, `editProfile.*`, `payoutCosmo.*`, `dashboard.orders.*`) — never `demo.` in snippets.
- Images/icons via asset map (`useAssetUrl` / `usePlanAssets` / `useEditProfileAssets`).

## Do not demo
- Near-identical chrome (e.g. three trailer CheckboxSwitch stateKeys, audio trailer that only changes accept/copy).
- File-name captions above samples.
- Dark section stage backgrounds.
- Duplicate ThumbnailUploader samples inside Media Uploader / Plan / Edit Profile demos — those belong only here.
